              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Centro de Periodismo Investigativo, Inc., according to Centro de Periodismo Investigativo, Inc., cPI argues that Section 2126(a) of PROMESA provides that any action against the Oversight Board shall be brought in the Federal District Court for Puerto Rico, indicating a clear waiver of sovereign immunity."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "CPI",
          "citations": [
            {
